OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fresh start with early mist
OL,6,Fand fog patches soon clearing.
OL,7,FOtherwise, it will be mostly dry and
OL,8,Ffine, with sunny spells and only a
OL,9,Fslight chance of a shower across the
OL,10,Fhigher ground in the north.
OL,11,FTemperatures near average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining dry and fine
OL,14,Fovernight with lengthy clear skies. A
OL,15,Ffew mist and fog patches forming under
OL,16,Fthe clear skies, with temperatures
OL,17,Ffalling into single figures in rural
OL,18,Fareas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
