OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FAnother largely dry day with
OL,6,Fsunny spells, especially in the west.
OL,7,FEastern areas may see cloud
OL,8,Foccasionally move in from the North
OL,9,FSea, with the odd spot of rain
OL,10,Fpossible.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FStaying mostly dry on Tuesday, before
OL,14,Fit turn unsettled during midweek with
OL,15,Fbands of rain and showers moving
OL,16,Facross the area. The rain potentially
OL,17,Fturning heavy and thundery at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
